## Cloud Agent vs IDE Chat — when to pick which

| Task profile | Pick |
|---|---|
| Interactive, iterative, ambiguous scope | IDE Chat |
| Cross-domain, production-sensitive | IDE Chat with `@<PROJECT_SLUG>-orchestrator` |
| Narrow, single-domain | IDE Chat with `@<specialist>` |
| Well-defined, self-contained, junior-level | Cloud Agent (assign GitHub issue) |
| Need to step away while it works | Cloud Agent |
| Sensitive code that should stay in IDE | IDE Chat |

