## Reminder for Copilot when starting a session

```
Re-read .github/copilot-instructions.md and docs/ai-context/INDEX.md.
Identify task type → pick the minimum docs + agent.
Verify .github/instructions/*.instructions.md auto-loaded for paths you'll edit.
Use a specialist agent via @<name> only when useful.
Smallest safe change.
Definition of done includes instruction files referenced.
```
